d", "Alhamdulillah tahun ni dh tiga tahun sy guna resepi ni. Terima kasih Pn Haziah kerana berkongsi resepi yg kidah n menyelerakan seperti ini.", "Assalam kak zie.mohon halalkan ye sya tiru resepi2 kak zie.tqvm", "resepi dr Puan Azie alhamdulillah menjadi...terima kasih", "Resipi akak sedap dan mudah!!! ", "Dah cuba masak pagi td.. alhamdulillah.. menjadi.. mmg sedap.. TQ kak azie.. resepi mmg sllu menjadi..\ud83d\ude0a", "dari tahun lalu semua resepi biskut,kek dan sampailah masakan saya ikut resepi kak Azie. Semuanya menjadi dan sedap, terima kasih kongsi resepi2 ini."], "page_comment_time": ["29 September, 2015 18:43", "29 September, 2015 21:11", "29 September, 2015 21:40", "30 September, 2015 08:53", "30 September, 2015 11:42", "03 Disember, 2015 20:18", "28 Disember, 2015 05:41", "25 Jun, 2018 11:33", "27 Februari, 2016 12:42", "07 Mac, 2016 01:33", "07 Mac, 2016 08:13", "07 Mac, 2016 13:41", "05 Jun, 2017 13:14", "26 Mac, 2016 13:38", "26 Mac, 2016 23:06", "05 April, 2016 17:08", "05 April, 2016 19:06", "21 Jun, 2016 10:30", "29 Jun, 2016 12:39", "04 Julai, 2016 16:26", "05 Julai, 2016 13:08", "05 Julai, 2016 23:01", "08 Julai, 2016 14:52", "10 Julai, 2016 21:02", "15 Julai, 2016 09:50", "15 Julai, 2016 23:21", "15 Julai, 2016 23:44", "26 Julai, 2016 00:10", "02 Ogos, 2016 21:11", "20 Ogos, 2016 18:15", "12 September, 2016 15:45", "15 September, 2016 23:08", "09 Oktober, 2016 09:54", "09 Oktober, 2016 23:45", "11 Oktober, 2016 16:42", "11 Oktober, 2016 16:53", "05 Januari, 2017 21:57", "25 Februari, 2017 17:43", "01 Mac, 2017 16:56", "28 April, 2017 15:03", "08 Jun, 2017 17:48", "18 Jun, 2017 06:51", "20 Jun, 2017 22:20", "24 Jun, 2017 10:04", "26 Jun, 2017 15:08", "01 Julai, 2017 18:02", "04 Julai, 2017 21:24", "31 Ogos, 2017 13:39", "26 April, 2018 01:17", "05 Jun, 2018 16:59", "05 Jun, 2018 17:00", "05 Jun, 2018 22:45", "14 Jun, 2018 19:06", "14 Jun, 2018 20:08", "15 Jun, 2018 07:45", "21 Ogos, 2018 05:49", "21 Ogos, 2018 05:50", "21 Ogos, 2018 20:42", "20