{"list_scraping_time": "1640924894", "url_search": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search?q=tahu&updated-max=2014-07-10T23:46:00%2B08:00&max-results=20&start=497&by-date=false", "list_item_url": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/2013/05/koleksi-resepi-nasi-ayam-azie-kitchen.html", "list_item_title": "Koleksi Resepi Nasi Ayam Azie Kitchen", "list_item_author_name": "Azie", "list_item_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "list_item_post_date": "4/13/2014", "list_item_post_comment_count": "\n18\n                              Comments\n                           \n", "list_item_category": "\nAyam\n", "list_item_category_link": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Ayam?max-results=6", "page_scraping_time": "1640924894", "page_title": "Koleksi Resepi Nasi Ayam Azie Kitchen", "page_author_name": "Azie Kitchen", "page_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "page_post_date": "4/13/2014", "page_item_category": ["Ayam", "Nasi", "Nasi Ayam", "Resepi Nasi Ayam"], "page_item_category_link": ["https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Ayam?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Nasi?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Nasi%20Ayam?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Resepi%20Nasi%20Ayam?max-results=6"], "page_description": ["Kalau ditanya kenapa saya punya banyak sekali resepi Nasi Ayam? Jawabnya kerana anak anak saya memang suka sangat makan nasi ayam. Bila tak tahu apa yang ingin dimasak hatta apa yang ingin dibeli, pasti nasi ayam lah yang menjadi penyelamat. Atas sebab itulah, saya seronok untuk mencuba pelbagai resepi Nasi Ayam. Malahan sebelum mencuba resepi Nasi Ayam Hainan, saya membaca banyak blog blog masakan terutama dari Singapura supaya saya dapat menghasilkan Nasi Ayam Hainan yang original. Ini adalah antara nasi ayam kegemaran saya sendiri terutama Nasi Ayam Hainan di Chicken Rice Shop.", "Jom kita layan koleksi resepi resepi Nasi Ayam yang ada dalam blog Azie Kitchen. Tujuan saya meletakkan di sini adalah untuk memudahkan rujukan saya sendiri. Sebenarnya ada 2 lagi resepi yang belum sempat, saya cuba. Insya Allah, saya pasti akan mencuba 2 lagi resepi itu di masa yang sesuai kelak. Kalau nak tengok resepi, klik sahaja di link di bawah gambar gambar di bawah. Jom layan....", "http://aziejaya.blogspot.com/2012/02/nasi-ayam-istimewa-yang-sangat-sedap.html", "http://aziejaya.blogspot.com/2011/12/nasi-ayam-ipoh-yang-sedap.html", "http://aziejaya.blogspot.com/2012/01/nasi-ayam-hainan.html", "http://aziejaya.blogspot.com/2013/01/nasi-ayam-nur-qaseh-untuk-brunch-di.html", "http://aziejaya.blogspot.com/2012/11/nasi-ayam-nur-qaseh-di-hari-maal-hijrah.html", "http://aziejaya.blogspot.com/2012/10/nasi-ayam-sempoi.html", "http://aziejaya.blogspot.com/2012/03/nasi-ayam-original.html", "http://aziejaya.blogspot.com/2012/02/nasi-ayam-kukus-dan-ayam-panggang.html", "http://aziejaya.blogspot.com/2013/04/nasi-ayam-paling-sedap.html", "http://aziejaya.blogspot.com/2013/04/nasi-ayam-kak-laily-subang-jaya-yang.html", "Haaa jika anda sedang tercari cari resepi Nasi Ayam, pilih sahaja mana mana resepi yang disukai. Semuanya sedap pada kami sebab kami memang penggemar Nasi Ayam. Tapi resepi yang paling banyak dicuba oleh pembaca blog Azie Kitchen adalah resepi Nasi Ayam Istimewa.", "Selamat mencuba..."], "page_description_image_url": ["https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-eG8S4y5V-P0/UWk_czCO6TI/AAAAAAAAZak/4fr6PL9psUU/s1600/IMG_7561.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-eGhDgaPTzxU/UWk_itf6nwI/AAAAAAAAZas/abpR4TikAXY/s1600/nasi+ayam+istimewa.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-PeQ40wXzs-o/UWk_qHNYtaI/AAAAAAAAZa0/3OlQe9sLg5M/s1600/nasi+ayam+ipoh.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-S_xZGUsvtpM/UWk_vLwnGiI/AAAAAAAAZa8/8FqDJTVkhQA/s1600/nasi+ayam+hainan.JPG", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-rB2ZrESNjOo/UWk_0mJ6hFI/AAAAAAAAZbE/3pMZuRGR7LE/s1600/nasi+ayam+nur+qaseh+brunch.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/--MMPwQ7xHvg/UWlAAn3FcII/AAAAAAAAZbM/1rGl9OEX8zs/s1600/nasi+ayam+kukus+maal+hijrah.jpg", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-YZ7WM0iaU6g/UWlAFWmpwEI/AAAAAAAAZbU/RTj8Bujd80k/s1600/nasi+ayam+sempoi.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-IwWixa8Oswo/UWlAKqhRrxI/AAAAAAAAZbc/ZpdEp8vGa6o/s1600/nasi+ayam+original+1.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-isGXaskpIE4/UWlAPZbJFkI/AAAAAAAAZbk/Ye8NwzWVyQs/s1600/nasi+ayam+kukus.JPG", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-vzWnBi0P2tw/UWlAV6vuQTI/AAAAAAAAZbs/naComkAc8so/s1600/nasi+ayam+plg+sedap+nani.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-XQ9nKmFOAK8/UWpMqaXcHEI/AAAAAAAAZcQ/4ErmOBD9xIM/s1600/IMG_0575.JPG", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5F0Srg3JQtM/U0Kh_ldj29I/AAAAAAAAd24/4ZYmjpQhSp8/s1600/IMG_4020.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-4b963_4hBFc/U5XH6bTI0xI/AAAAAAAAeYE/ZxWqgCYxe4I/s1600/IMG_6789.jpg"], "page_ulasan_count": "18 ulasan", "page_comment": ["assalam kak Azie", "banyak koleksi nasi ayam sedap2 belaka tu", "sy pernah cuba resepi nasi ayam k azie ni tak silap yg sgt istimewa dan sedap tu", "betul sedap anak2 sy kata sedap dan suka mkan", "Terima kasih mama kerana mencuba dan memberi maklumbalas di sini", "Salam kak Azie..sy pensh cuba resepi kal Azie nasi ayam y paling sedap tu..mmg sedap sgt.dn sy mntk izin share resepi tu kt blog sy..", "Terima kasih kerana sudi mencuba dan memberi maklumbalas di sini", "Salam KakAzie,", "lepas nie boleh buat 'Azie Chicken Rice Shop'.. bukan sekadar nasi ayam ;-)", "Hahaha Love the idea..", "wah kak siap ade koleksi lg..nti bleh la cuba mana2 resepi kt atas tu...nmpk mnarik n sedap2 semuanya", "Assalam sis azie... Sy suka dengan blog sis... Mohon izin share resepi utk main masak2 dirumah yer... Tq :))", "Wslm. Silakan, sis", "As slm kak Azie,", "terima kasih sudi share resipi2, mmg dari dulu suka sgt blog kak azie. Mmg semua resipi sedap2 belaka.", "mmg btul tu azie.anak2 akak pon suka makan nasi ayam ni:>", "Nafas baru untuk nasik ayam klasik saya selama ni..terima kasih atas perkongsian ilmu puan..:)", "sitinorazizah920702.blogspot.com", "Waa..thanks dear sharing pasal nasi ayam", "actualy saya pun ader resepi nasi ayam.", "Mak saya yang ajar.", "Bole klik link blog nasi ayam saya", "http://www.chekuseeha.com/nasi-ayam-bonda.html", "akak..lepas ni buat nasi ayam karamel plak", "wow... bestnya banyak kolesi nak try satu per satu la ni.. sebab sy peminat nasi ayam... selalu masak yg ayam kukus ja.. ", "kalau ada masa boleh singgah lawat2 di blog saya. TQ", "http://beautyhealthylifestyle.blogspot.com", "wow banyak gambar, terliur rasa...mmg nak cari resepi neh...sbb tak pernah buat sendiri", "Bestnya.. nk try wat la. Tq for the resipi.. ", "best nya...nati nk cuba buat la,nk copy paste resepi ini ke blog saya..mohon izin dari tuan punya resepi ya kak azie utk share resepi2..nk tunaikan hasrat en.hubby yg mnta masakkan nasi aym,so blog Azie Kitchen jadi rujukan saya..hehe"], "page_comment_time": ["24 Mei, 2013 19:13", "25 Mei, 2013 11:46", "24 Mei, 2013 20:08", "25 Mei, 2013 11:45", "25 Mei, 2013 11:42", "25 Mei, 2013 11:44", "28 Mei, 2013 15:49", "27 Julai, 2013 15:46", "13 April, 2014 19:14", "24 April, 2014 17:26", "13 Julai, 2014 12:18", "28 Oktober, 2014 03:45", "14 November, 2014 05:40", "17 November, 2014 09:39", "27 November, 2014 11:42", "30 November, 2014 14:46", "12 Februari, 2015 13:15", "10 Oktober, 2016 16:15"], "page_comment_user": ["mama sara nur @ Cik Nor", "Azie", "Unknown", "Azie", "Yong Is My Name", "Azie", "Qasey Honey", "Nur", "Azie", "an", "Unknown", "Unknown", "Mommy zara", "Unknown", "Beauty & healthy Lifestyle", "faridah", "Unknown", "Debook.blogspot.com"], "page_comment_user_url": ["https://www.blogger.com/profile/08532066347487514240", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/08795078447244193949", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/10495388408470761070", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/15660698964880170957", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/024073116657556