{"list_scraping_time": "1640924968", "url_search": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search?q=tahu&updated-max=2012-09-11T22:03:00%2B08:00&max-results=20&start=598&by-date=false", "list_item_url": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/2012/09/masak-lemak-cili-padi-ikan-jenahak.html", "list_item_title": "Masak Lemak Cili Padi Ikan Jenahak", "list_item_author_name": "Azie", "list_item_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "list_item_post_date": "9/02/2012", "list_item_post_comment_count": "\n6\n                              Comments\n                           \n", "list_item_category": "\nIkan\n", "list_item_category_link": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Ikan?max-results=6", "page_scraping_time": "1640924969", "page_title": "Masak Lemak Cili Padi Ikan Jenahak", "page_author_name": "Azie Kitchen", "page_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "page_post_date": "9/02/2012", "page_item_category": ["Ikan", "Lauk Pauk", "Seafood"], "page_item_category_link": ["https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Ikan?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Lauk%20Pauk?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Seafood?max-results=6"], "page_description": ["Aduh bila ikan segar, masak apa pun jadi sedap. Manis jer rasa kuahnya lebih lebih lagi menggunakan santan segar. Ini antara masakan feveret di dapur Azie dan sentiasa di ulang ulang masak.\u00a0", "Bagi yang dah tahu cara memasak masak lemak cili padi stail noghori, bolehlah jamu mata dengan gambar gambar jer. Selain Taugeh Goreng Kicap di ", ", lauk ini lah yang menjadi lauk hidangan makan malam kami semalam sempena cuti Hari Kemerdekaan yang ke55.", "Saya hari ini deman sangat dan badan menjadi sangat lemah. Rasa sungguh tak berselera. Hanya makan ketupat sotong jer beberapa ekor. Saya banyak menghabiskan masa dengan berehat sambil mendengar ceramah ceramah ugama dalam youtube yang memang sangat menginsafkan.\u00a0", "Saya gembira kerana telah berjaya menyempurnakan puasa 6 di bulan Syawal. Semoga saya dapat kembali kepada fitrah seperti yang disebut sebut dalam kuliah kuliah terawih sebelum ini. Saya berazam untuk melakukan apa sahaja amalan yang dituntut ugama dengan penuh istiqamah.", "Jom kita tengok resepi dulu...", "Oleh: ", "Bahan bahan:", "3 keping ikan jenahak", "7 biji cili padi", "1 inci kunyit hidup", "Santan secukupnya", "1 asam keping", "Garam", "Cara cara:", "Kisar semua bahan dengan sedikit santan. Masak dengan api perlahan sehingga hampir mendidih, masukkan ikan.", "Masak sambil terus dikacau supaya tidak pecah minyak. Masukkan asam keping dan garam secukupnya.", "Tutup api dan hidangkan dengan nasi putih panas panas."], "page_description_image_url": ["https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-R-IIRF8M0Sc/UEDKXU4nmlI/AAAAAAAATXU/rnPxhmmGaHo/s640/IMG_7056.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-KxBRiez5Hk0/UEDKfGN_9cI/AAAAAAAATX8/J8IEoRk6HGA/s640/IMG_7067.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-Y97A2dR7O1w/UEDKgQ9Qv0I/AAAAAAAATYE/aJCq-IFpn5w/s640/IMG_7069.jpg"], "page_ulasan_count": "6 ulasan", "page_comment": ["Salam perkenalan Azie,", "saya orang Nogori dah tentu resepi ni menjadi kesukaan, tapi saya jarang buat sebab anak saya tak berapa suka. Dia lebih suka kari sebab dulu babysitter dia keturunan mamak jadi kari dah jadi kebiasaan dia. Saya belum sempat buat puasa 6 lagi. Uzur lebih awal pulak, walaupun baru aje uzur seminggu sebelum raya. Insyaallah Isnin depan saya akan berpuasa.", "Selamat Hari Raya....", "Dear,saya mmg suka sangat masak lemak cili padi, selamat berpuasa enam ya", "This recipe is very simple and good. Anything with cili padi I like. ", "Yes, I love masak lemak cili padi and easy to cook", "Salam Azie, kalau rampaikan dengan belimbing buluh pun sedap.", "Bro, i dah lama juga tercari belimbing buluh, tapi tak dijual di kedai runcit area rumah kami. "], "page_comment_time": ["02 September, 2012 09:46", "02 September, 2012 11:16", "02 September, 2012 15:10", "02 September, 2012 17:30", "02 September, 2012 18:31", "02 September, 2012 21:02"], "page_comment_user": ["Marsita Yahya", "Azie", "PH", "Azie", "Engineers Love Cooking", "Azie"], "page_comment_user_url": ["https://www.blogger.com/profile/11992777448361598830", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/11010771600736676432", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/13940179655950973323", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318"], "page_comment_user_image_url": ["//2.bp.blogspot.com/-qr8CmdUPa50/WVrjrL8l1wI/AAAAAAAALlo/viJzIcAbbr0nNKcATI9x1NbCiaANlE7-QCK4BGAYYCw/s35/me12.jpg", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//2.bp.blogspot.com/-CyoZGHKCgLk/T81X70uH1RI/AAAAAAAABAM/sPIPOqupvfs/s35/Engineers%25252Bcook%25252Blike%25252Ba%25252Bchef%25252B5.jpg", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*"]}
{"list_scraping_time": "1640924968", "url_search": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search?q=tahu&updated-max=2012-09-11T22:03:00%2B08:00&max-results=20&start=598&by-date=false", "list_item_url": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/2012/08/kuah-lodeh-dan-nasi-impit.html", "list_item_title": "Kuah Lodeh Dan Nasi Impit", "list_item_author_name": "Azie", "list_item_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "list_item_post_date": "8/27/2012", "list_item_post_comment_count": "\n15\n                              Comments\n                           \n", "list_item_category": "\nLauk Pauk\n", "list_item_category_link": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Lauk%20Pauk?max-results=6", "page_scraping_time": "1640924969", "page_title": "Kuah Lodeh Dan Nasi Impit", "page_author_name": "Azie Kitchen", "page_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "page_post_date": "8/27/2012", "page_item_category": ["Lauk Pauk", "Raya 2012", "Sayur"], "page_item_category_link": ["https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Lauk%20Pauk?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Raya%202012?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Sayur?max-results=6"], "page_description": ["Tiba tiba teringat untuk memasak Kuah Lodeh apabila terima sms dari Izzad yang memberitahu ingin datang ke rumah malam nanti. Walaupun dipesan supaya saya tidak memasak apa apa, tetapi apa salahnya dimasak sesuatu kerana boleh juga kami makan semasa berbuka puasa nanti.\u00a0", "\n", "\n", "Saya tercari cari resepi kuah lodeh yang biasa saya buat tetapi tak menemuinya. Rasanya resepi tu, ada di dalam buku resepi saya yang terletak dalam bilik study. Resepi yang biasa digunakan itu, hanya dimasak begitu sahaja tanpa ditumis, Tapi kali ini saya cuba membuat yang versi tumis pula di", "\u00a0", ".", "\n", "\n", "Lontong dan kuah lodeh adalah masakan yang sangat versatile, boleh dimakan ketika sarapan, jamuan hari raya dan rumah terbuka, malahan boleh dimakan bila bila masa sahaja. Kalau dulu, saya menyediakan kuah kacang tetapi hari ini saya hanya menyediakan Sambal Tumis Ikan Bilis dan telur rebus sahaja.\u00a0", "\n", "\n", "Teringat lagi makan kuah lodeh yang sedap di rumah jiran kami di USJ di mana diletakkan sekali petai di dalamnya. Sebenarnya kita boleh letak apa apa jer sayuran yang disukai. Macam saya, biasanya akan memilih sayur yang terdiri dari pelbagai warna bagi memberi variasi warna pada kuah lodeh. Ada warna hijau, oren, merah, purple dan sebagainya.", "\n", "\n", "Seperti biasa lah, kita hanya guna nasi impit NONA jer, tak ada lontong di sini. Nasi impit ni sedap dan cantik jika disediakan semalaman sebelum digunakan. Selepas direbus disimpan di dalam peti sejuk, jadi potongannya kelak menjadi lebih kemas dan cantik. Telur pula direbus bersama dengan nasi impit, jadi bila tak dikacau kacau selalu, maka telur kuning tu tidak lah cantik terletak di tengah tengah telur putih. Kebanyakan masa, saya fail dalam hal merebus rebus telur ni.", "\n", "\n", "Jom tengok resepi yang saya gunakan pada hari ini....", "\u00a0", "\n", "Oleh: ", "\n", "\n", "Bahan-bahan (10 orang)", "Bahan Kisar:", "\n", "10 tangkai cili kering", "2 biji bawang besar", "2 ulas bawang putih", "1 jari kunyit hidup", "1 hiris halia", "2 sudu besar udang kering", "2 sudu besar ikan bilis (guna kiub ikan bilis)", "Sedikit belacan - jika suka", "2 sudu kecil\u00a0 jintan kasar - sangar", "Bahan Lain:", "\n", "2 batang serai - dititik", "4 helai daun salam", "1/2 jari lengkuas - diketuk", "200 gram udang hidup -\u00a0kupas kulit", "Bahan Sayur di potong kecil:", "1/2 biji kobis", "8 batang kacang panjang", "1 batang lobak merah", "1 biji sengkuang kecil", "1 biji terung panjang", "1 keping tahu kering - rendam", "4 biji kentang", "4 keping tauhu -\u00a0potong kecil dan goreng", "4 keping tempe - potong dan digoreng", "2 ikat su'un - rendam", "Cili\u00a0merah dan hijau - potong serong", "2 liter santan pekat dan cair\u00a0", "Air secukupnya", "Garam secukup rasa", "1/4 cawan minyak utk menumis", "Cara-cara:", "Panaskan minyak dlm periuk dan tumis bahan bahan kisar dan serai hingga wangi. Masukkan udang dan tumis lagi dan masukkan santan, daun salam, lengkuas dan masak hingga mendidih.", "\n", "\n", "Masukkan sayur sayuran bermula dgn yg keras dulu dan tambah air secukupnya hingga sayur tenggelam. Bubuh garam secukup rasa dan masak lagi hingga mendidih dan sayur lembut.", "\n", "\n", "\n", "Hidang sayur lodeh dgn nasi impit atau ketupat dengan sambal tumis atau sambal kacang\u00a0dan serunding. Masukkan juga telur yang direbus.", "\n", "\n", "\n", "Selamat menjamu selera....", "\n", "\n", "\n"], "page_description_image_url": ["https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-VcHPAqbpWME/UDtFP9U8w3I/AAAAAAAATMI/83UD4W0m8Ag/s640/IMG_6946.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-Sho6p3qBjec/UDtFHQ-6aVI/AAAAAAAATLY/NTc_3AIYkRs/s640/IMG_6930.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-AKNHO4Ba7wo/UDtFO2Me8tI/AAAAAAAATMA/YkTe4X4Y3Pc/s640/IMG_6939.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-YOuWUhCtObQ/UDszukCbuaI/AAAAAAAATHk/lNmOm_wub_4/s640/IMG_6877.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-RjDFD6vH9RA/UDszz-N4UeI/AAAAAAAATIE/Nv1mKZIDIqY/s640/IMG_6891.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-MZ33aDqN76w/UDtFWRGjlGI/AAAAAAAATMo/GGQYLXGPkvo/s640/IMG_6951.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-KrSjvJ71-Sw/UDtFZ7eKMwI/AAAAAAAATM4/A2lXGSSzbdI/s640/IMG_6954.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-kc7ZJDqfDPw/UDuI3c_0gWI/AAAAAAAATQI/AsNRb6FBBKk/s640/IMG_7008.JPG"], "page_ulasan_count": "15 ulasan", "page_comment": ["salam kenal kak azie..sedapnya nampak kuah lodeh..suka tgk senarai masakan kelantan..nanti ada masa leh cuba", " Ela, huhuhu menyesal sungguh sebab termakan banyak malam tadi. Tak boleh kontrol, sebab sedap...", "Salam, boleh dicuba lontong kering.  Guna rendang, serunding, sambal/sayur goreng, kuah kacang/sambal tumis dan telur.  Sedap.", "Salam, kalau buat lontong kering pun sedap.  Guna rendang, serunding, sambal/sayur goreng, kuah kacang dan telur rebus.", "tekak klate ku mcm tk blh terima je kuah lodeh ni kak... tk tau nape...", "Zura, tekak Klate saya dulu pun macam tu jugak. Tapi loni dah boleh lah cuma klu makane Klate juga yang mmg 100% serasi.", "Salam, kalau buat lontong kering pun sedap. guna rendang, serunding, kuah kacang, sambal/sayur goreng dan telur rebus.  Ini kali ketiga komen, yang dua tak appear kat sini.", "Bro, entah kenapa komen tu termasuk dalam spam. Itu sebab tak keluar. Ohh mcm mana lontong kering tu? Tk ada berkuah santan ke? Nak kena  cuba juga ni. Terima kasih atas cadangan", "adusss, sedapnya nampak !", "Lodeh memang sedap terutama kalau guna udang fresh. Apalagi kalau digandingkan dg sambal tumis yg dibuat pekat kering. Aduh 3 kali tambah, sis", "Salam, kak.. Terima kasih atas perkongsian resepi ni, memang nak try. Nak tanya, resepi diatas ni untuk hidangan berapa orang ek??", "Inumadeeha, memang dapat satu periuk besar. Rasanya utk 10 ke 15 orang pun boleh", "salam akak, apa beza dengan kuah lodeh yg lain yang akak buat. yg ni byk bahan kisar.", "Rasanya pasti berbeza. Kena cuba sendiri, baru tahu perbezaannya. Semua pun sedap", "Nampak sedap ni! Nok keno cubo ghetek ni!"], "page_comment_time": ["28 Ogos, 2012 08:44", "28 Ogos, 2012 09:17", "28 Ogos, 2012 09:37", "28 Ogos, 2012 10:40", "28 Ogos, 2012 10:42", "28 Ogos, 2012 11:25", "28 Ogos, 2012 11:45", "29 Ogos, 2012 07:46", "28 Ogos, 2012 19:06", "28 Ogos, 2012 19:28", "03 September, 2012 10:42", "04 September, 2012 12:49", "23 Julai, 2015 08:20", "23 Julai, 2015 09:36", "03 Jun, 2018 13:56"], "page_comment_user": ["cikla", "Azie", "Engineers Love Cooking", "Engineers Love Cooking", "Zura", "Azie", "Engineers Love Cooking", "Azie", "NoorMasri", "Azie", "Solehah Misaha", "Azie", "Unknown", "Azie", "DN \u2022  Lo t f i"], "page_comment_user_url": ["https://www.blogger.com/profile/09644482730963658227", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/13940179655950973323", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/13940179655950973323", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/05596667260287902036", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/13940179655950973323", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/05963134110506119297", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/11945252622652336086", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/04924829181894911067", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/16126684672383836004"], "page_comment_user_image_url": ["//1.bp.blogspot.com/-tvjO8_9d-NY/W1makLSt8YI/AAAAAAAAEyc/DmlE45OCcgEtAo1FJwpDA_ZS1usaxRChACK4BGAYYCw/s35/IMG_20180605_202658_904.jpg", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//2.bp.blogspot.com/-CyoZGHKCgLk/T81X70uH1RI/AAAAAAAABAM/sPIPOqupvfs/s35/Engineers%25252Bcook%25252Blike%25252Ba%25252Bchef%25252B5.jpg", "//2.bp.blogspot.com/-CyoZGHKCgLk/T81X70uH1RI/AAAAAAAABAM/sPIPOqupvfs/s35/Engineers%25252Bcook%25252Blike%25252Ba%25252Bchef%25252B5.jpg", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//2.bp.blogspot.com/-CyoZGHKCgLk/T81X70uH1RI/AAAAAAAABAM/sPIPOqupvfs/s35/Engineers%25252Bcook%25252Blike%25252Ba%25252Bchef%25252B5.jpg", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//1.bp.blogspot.com/_iFzi1em1i0I/TQ9bkgiFRuI/AAAAAAAAAVI/446SSlLErI4/S45-s35/mag9.jpg", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//4.bp.blogspot.com/-6x3_IaMaX-8/YYHq7zvVbhI/AAAAAAAADQs/WpeN3GIoygIh0cjWRBt-unAriQEZX-LtgCK4BGAYYCw/s35/photo_2021-11-02_11-00-28.jpg", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//4.bp.blogspot.com/-lA1LQJOQDB8/WV0YjQcrjvI/AAAAAAAADL4/kabZquVQ1LgZuiCZ3lJK1jYkb2otENb8gCK4BGAYYCw/s35/FullSizeRender%25252B%252525285%25252529.jpg"]}
{"list_scraping_time": "1640924968", "url_search": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search?q=tahu&updated-max=2012-09-11T22:03:00%2B08:00&max-results=20&start=598&by-date=false", "list_item_url": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/2012/08/sotong-masak-kicap-pedas.html", "list_item_title": "Sotong Masak Kicap Pedas", "list_item_author_name": "Azie", "list_item_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "list_item_post_date": "8/31/2012", "list_item_post_comment_count": "\n9\n                              Comments\n                           \n", "list_item_category": "\nLauk Pauk\n", "list_item_category_link": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Lauk%20Pauk?max-results=6", "page_scraping_time": "1640924969", "page_title": "Sotong Masak Kicap Pedas", "page_author_name": "Azie Kitchen", "page_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "page_post_date": "8/31/2012", "page_item_category": ["Lauk Pauk", "Seafood", "Sotong"], "page_item_category_link": ["https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Lauk%20Pauk?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Seafood?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Sotong?max-results=6"], "page_description": ["Hmmm jangan tak tahu, minggu ni minggu masak kicap. Sebabnya nak mudah, keduanya kekonon tak berselera makan lauk pauk berlemak di musim perayaan. Hahaha betul ke gitu atau memang malas nak memasak yang susah susah. Kan masak kicap ni mudah.", "\n", "\n", "\n", "Masa balik dari kedai runcit beli ayam untuk dibuat rendang yang mahu dimakan dengan lemang, tengok hubby beli sekali 6 ekor sotong. Laaa apa nak buat ni? Baru beberapa hari lepas buat Sambal Tumis Sotong dan semalam pulak buat Ketupat Sotong.\u00a0", "Jadi terus dapat idea untuk Masak Kicap Pedas Sotong pulak. Baru lengkap sebab baru ni dah buat ikan, ayam dan kali ini sotong. Lain kali buat pulak daging dan telur. Alahaaai senangnya hidup...", "Jom tengok resepi dulu....\u00a0", "\n", "Oleh: ", "\n", "\n", "Bahan bahan:", "\n", "6 ekor sotong \u00a0- hiris nipis", "\n", "1 labu bawang besar - hiris bulat", "\n", "1 biji cili hidup merah/hijau - hiris", "\n", "1 sudu besar cili kisar - ikut pedas disukai", "\n", "Daun sadri/daun bawang - hiris", "\n", "Susu pekat", "\n", "Kulit kayu manis dan buah pelaga", "\n", "\n", "Bahan sos:", "\n", "Kicap pekat", "\n", "Kicap manis", "\n", "Sos tomato", "\n", "Sos tiram", "\n", "\n", "Bahan bahan kisar:", "\n", "1/2 labu bawang besar\u00a0", "\n", "5 ulas bawang merah", "\n", "2 ulas bawang putih", "\n", "1/2 inci halia", "\n", "\n", "Cara-cara:", "\n", "Panaskan minyak dan tumis rempah penumis dan bahan-bahan kisar hingga wangi. Kemudian masukkan cili kisar dan tumis sehingga cili garing dan masak.", "\n", "\n", "Masukkan kicap pekat, kicap manis, susu pekat, sos tomato dan sos tiram. Kacau hingga sebati. Masukkan sedikit sahaja air kerana sotong akan mengeluarkan air yang banyak.", "\n", "\n", "Setelah mendidih, \u00a0bawang besar dan cili hiris. \u00a0Akhir sekali masukkan sotong. Gaul-gaulkan seketika sebelum ditutup api.\u00a0", "\n", "\n", "Sebelum dihidangkan, taburkan sedikit hirisan daun sadri atau daun bawang.", "\n", "\n"], "page_description_image_url": ["https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-dDIp_W4pGl8/UDmp3kLYYOI/AAAAAAAAS98/UynWwzv0u7Y/s640/IMG_6791.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-bjJTsLnAxGc/UDmp5vKX6_I/AAAAAAAAS-E/spTL5OAq9g0/s640/IMG_6793.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-VH7CQm1Jqa8/UDmp7hOsd7I/AAAAAAAAS-M/2vFBD1bRFpg/s640/IMG_6797.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-EtscSRL82fE/UDmp9RkLR9I/AAAAAAAAS-U/qjbpFh304Y8/s640/IMG_6799.jpg"], "page_ulasan_count": "9 ulasan", "page_comment": ["Salam sejahtera Azie", "Salam hari kemerdekaan Azie!", "hehe saya , emak semuanya suka masak kicap- dulu kami tak masukkan cili kisar, skrg mesti masuk , nak bg rasa umph!", "hari ni ke mana?", "Selamat Hari Kemerdekaan Utk Mama ju juga. Hari ni dok kat rumah jer sebab tak berapa sihat sikit", "Aduh Kak, sy terlebih letak air trus jd kuah sup hahgaha 1st trial to husband xtau nk kata hahaha", "Memasak ni tk ada istilah salah dan silap. Kalau terlebih kuah, anggaplah memang utk dibuat kuah. Hahahaha tak gitu", "untuk apa yer nak guna susu pekat? akak x sebut tentang susu pekat dalam masakan pun. bila nak masuk susu pekat tu?", "Oh maaf. Ini adalah saya tambah kemudian berdasarkan feedback yg diberi oleh seorang sahabat blogger saya. Boleh dimasukkan di akhir bersama dengan kicap semua tu. ianya untuk membuatkan rasa lemak manis. Rasa gula berbeza dg rasa susu pekat", "salam kak azie. saya nak tanya bahan bahan yang akak tulis kat atas tu ada tertera susu pekat. masa bila yer nak masukkan susu pekat tu?", "Boleh dimasukkan selepas masukkan kicap semua tu. ", "Tq tuk resepi...br nk masak ni...alter2 skit xpe kan...hehehe..cili kisar xde.."], "page_comment_time": ["31 Ogos, 2012 07:12", "31 Ogos, 2012 19:32", "20 Februari, 2013 20:50", "20 Februari, 2013 21:35", "12 April, 2013 11:17", "12 April, 2013 11:40", "12 April, 2013 11:18", "12 April, 2013 11:41", "14 April, 2014 20:32"], "page_comment_user": ["mama ju", "Azie", "Unknown", "Azie", "Unknown", "Azie", "Unknown", "Azie", "Aei"], "page_comment_user_url": ["https://www.blogger.com/profile/15405383003114766666", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/10627760902059624520", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/06164307065668617226", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/06164307065668617226", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/04027463979289513194"], "page_comment_user_image_url": ["//4.bp.blogspot.com/-2tN8QFuQZcc/V-KFwy6Q0oI/AAAAAAAANvE/0c7RUciKepEKU9oBEgc2PbcpOVN9-AANgCK4B/s35/myfamily%25252709.jpg", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png"]}
{"list_scraping_time": "1640924968", "url_search": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search?q=tahu&updated-max=2012-09-11T22:03:00%2B08:00&max-results=20&start=598&by-date=false", "list_item_url": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/2012/08/ayam-masak-kicap-pedas.html", "list_item_title": "Ayam Masak Kicap Pedas Yang Sedap", "list_item_author_name": "Azie", "list_item_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "list_item_post_date": "8/26/2012", "list_item_post_comment_count": "\n51\n                              Comments\n                           \n", "list_item_category": "\nAyam\n", "list_item_category_link": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Ayam?max-results=6", "page_scraping_time": "1640924969", "page_title": "Ayam Masak Kicap Pedas Yang Sedap", "page_author_name": "Azie Kitchen", "page_author_url": "https://draft.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "page_post_date": "8/26/2012", "page_item_category": ["Ayam", "Lauk Pauk"], "page_item_category_link": ["https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Ayam?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Lauk%20Pauk?max-results=6"], "page_description": ["Hari jumaat lepas, saya memasak Ikan Bawal Emas Masak Kicap Pedas di ", ". Di situ rakan blogger saya di ", " beri komen yang jika diletak susu pekat dan sedikit lada hitam menjadi Ayam Masak Black Rose.\u00a0", "Pagi semalam semasa ke masjid, tanya hubby apa nak masak ayam tapi dia hanya mendiamkan diri bila saya menyebut Kari Ayam atau Ayam Masak Merah.\u00a0", "Oleh kerana tak tahu apa yang dimasak dengan ayam yang hubby beli di Pasar TTDI, saya pun terfikir untuk mencuba apa yang disarankan. Hmmm boleh tahan juga sedapnya.\u00a0", "Kalau semasa memasak ikan, saya meletakkan sedikit gula tapi hari ini digantikan dengan susu pekat manis. Satu kuali besar yang dibuat, laju jer hubby dengan anak anak makan. Aween makan menambah nambah dan makan berulang ulang kali.\u00a0", "Saya rasa sungguh seronok bila mereka suka apa yang saya masak. Kebetulan saya mengupas ubi kentang untuk dibuat begedil, jadi sebiji saya hiris nipis, goreng dan masukkan sekali ke dalamnya. Sedaaap ni, tak tipu nyeer. Kalau tak caya, cuba buat sendiri dan rasa sendiri. hahaha boleh gitu pulak ya...", "Di samping Ayam Masak Kicap Pedas ni, saya juga membuat Masak Lemak Putih Terung dan Begedil Ayam di ", " untuk hidangan tengahari kami di hujung minggu. \u00a0", "Jom kita tengok resepi dulu...", "Oleh: ", "\n", "Bahan bahan:", "Ayam - lumur garam kunyit dan goreng", "1 biji ubi kentang - hiris nipis dan goreng", "1 labu bawang besar - hiris bulat", "1 biji cili hidup merah/benggala - hiris", "1 sudu besar cili kisar - ikut pedas disukai", "Daun sadri/daun bawang - hiris", "Susu pekat manis", "Lada hitam - tumbuk kasar", "Rempah penumis: Kayu manis, bunga lawang, buah pelaga", "\n", "Bahan sos:", "Kicap pekat", "Kicap manis", "Sos tomato", "Sos tiram", "Bahan bahan kisar:", "1/2 labu bawang besar", "5 ulas bawang merah", "2 ulas bawang putih", "1/2 inci halia", "\n", "\n", "Cara-cara :", "\n", "Panaskan minyak dan tumis rempah penumis bersama bahan-bahan kisar hingga wangi. Kemudian masukkan cili kisar dan tumis sehingga cili garing dan masak.", "\n", "\n", "Masukkan kicap pekat, kicap manis, sos tomato dan sos tiram. Kacau hingga sebati. Masukkan air.", "\n", "\n", "Setelah mendidih, \u00a0masukkan susu pekat, serbuk lada hitam, bawang besar dan cili hidup.\u00a0", "Akhir sekali masukkan ayam bersama ubi kentang yang digoreng. Gaul-gaulkan seketika sebelum ditutup api.\u00a0", "\n", "\n", "Sebelum dihidangkan, taburkan sedikit hirisan daun sadri atau daun bawang.", "Selamat mencuba....", "\n", "\n"], "page_description_image_url": ["https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-zGGB9WNxphE/UDhYcgkkOkI/AAAAAAAAS1c/o2DYyLqlfx0/s640/IMG_6594.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-s8HUAuzXT7g/UDhYgdmXDWI/AAAAAAAAS1s/XpjymzknddU/s640/IMG_6598.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-J25bScqzbdI/UDhYXsRNP4I/AAAAAAAAS1E/JkoBCxWjbKQ/s400/IMG_6587.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-nhaSoBwK3eA/UDhYn7yLFAI/AAAAAAAAS2M/zctG9iploKI/s400/IMG_6606.jpg", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/--UGTYHkeQ8k/UDhYl8JTM6I/AAAAAAAAS2E/dIYbsMXjUl8/s640/IMG_6605.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-WCauIl0BNhM/UDhYJOrLp4I/AAAAAAAAS0E/3jF7ln0hsxw/s640/IMG_6575.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-kzlDy8FckCg/UDhYerblgdI/AAAAAAAAS1k/yoxWTfEKrHM/s640/IMG_6596.jpg"], "page_ulasan_count": "51 ulasan", "page_comment": ["wow nie pebret D5 nie..Nampak sedap sgt masak kicap Azie nie :D", "D5, musim raya ni memang sedap lauk lauk macam ni sebab kalau asyik berlemak pun dah tak berselera juga, maklumlah perut kita masih dalam mood puasa,", "Salam sejahtera Azie", "terimakasih Azie. Ni nak pi dapur nak buat sbgmana saranan, macam sedap je.", "Mama Ju, buat jangan tak buat. Masih dalam suasana raya ni, jadi lauk begini sangat sedap. Kalau ikut bro Engineers Love Cooking, namanya Ayam Black Rose", "susu pekat tu nak letak byk mana ye?", "Ianya berfungsi utk mengganti gula. Tapi berlemak. Jadi masuklah sedikit dulu dan rasalah manisnya", "Kalo pakai susu cair boleh x puan", "susu pekat tu yg mcm mna ye ?", "Susu pekat manis biasa yg org guna utk buat teh tarik tu", "dh cuba dh n mmg sedap.... tengs azie share resepi 2...:-)", "Sama sama. Kami sgt suka resepi ini. Harap you juga menggemarinya", "kalau x nak taruk susu pekat tu pon boleh kan?", "Boleh jer. Ganti dg sedikit gula", "Boleh azie share resepi Ayam Masak Merah Pedas..", "boleh try ni, lain cket resipinye sbb letak susu pekat ... heee tQ share resipi", "lapa pulak mlm2 ni tgok blog akak..best3 masakan akak...sedapnyeee....... ;)", "Assalamualaikum kak... wish me luck ye.. Nk masak ni... ", "(*\u00af\ufe36\u00af*) nanti da post kat blog saya bg link ye.. tunggu resultnya.. ", "salam.. akk nk tnye bahan sos tu nk bubuh banyak mne ye? lada hitam pun bnyak mne ye?", "Wslm. Bubuh agak agak dan kemudian rasa lah. Kalau belum cukup pedas tambah lagi lada hitam. ", "kak, ayu share kat blog. somi ayu masak ritu. hihi", "Susu manis nk letak bape byk??", "nk wat skrg gak ni...nmpk menyelerakan", "Nk test ptang ni...bka posa", "Kak Azie, thank u sgt2 sbb share resipi ni.. Hasben & anak2 really enjoy :)", "Sy dh try..memg terbaekkj..tq kak", "Sy dh cube mmg sedap..ank2 sy suke sgt..thank kak bg resepi...", "Mmg sedap...dah try...mcm ala2 org jawa masak kicap dgn nasi ambeng....:)", "Salam Pn Azie...minta maaf tanya, bahan kisar tu apa bahannya ye...", "Nk cuba masak cam sedap je .", "Suda try masak hri ni utk mknn tghri. Husband suka siap menambah nasi lagi. Next time dia mau lagi. Memang sedappp!", "butuh ape sedap", "Salam pn azie, ni confirm ke kena letak susu pekat manis?untuk apa yea?", "Wslm. Fungsi susu pekat adalah utk memberi rasa manis spt gula. Cuma bila menggunakan susu pekat, akan lebih memberi rasa lemak juga", "Kicap pekat kalau takde nak ganti dgan apa ya puan?", "Terima kasih kak Azie, resepi sudah di cuba. Puas hati, :-)", "Salam..klo xguna halia blh x..", "terima kasih..", "Tq.arini pening takde idea dh nk masak. Pastu jumpa blog nie \ud83d\ude0a", "Terima kasih resepinya.. mmg sedap sgt.. nak try masak berkali2, membuka selera btul lauk ni.. ", "Terima kasih azie \ud83d\ude0a", "Tq for the resipi.. Selalu follow resipi blog akak ni... ", "Nak tanya, kalau kicap pekat takda nak ganti dengan apa ya?", "Nk try masak berbuka nti...", "Terima kasih kpd admin. Selama 6 tahun saya berada di Egypt, sume resepi saya google, datang dari blog ni. :D ", "Belajar Medic ke. Anak saya dulu belajar di Alex Uni. ", "thanks the receipe kak azie...", "Kak Azie, kalau nak bagi berkuah sikit nak kena letak air asam @ air biasa je? ", "Em sedap nye kak azie", "Oyeayy..biasa letak nisang(gula melaka) or gula terus kalau nk manis,x prnah lagi letak susu pekat..wajib try ni..resepi puan azie x pernah mengecewakan..thanks", "Nak tanya berapa sudu setiap sos?", "Sy buat berkuah...bila tgk gambar,  mcm x jadi. Xtau nk agak sos,  kicap & air byk mana. Hahaha!...  tpi tgk semua org mkn. Kira jadi ler tu...  ", "terima kasih resepi..boleh cuba ..jemput singgah blog saya ea: dirawanhartawan.blogsport.com", "Alhdulillah,  dh cuba.. Resepi terbaeek"], "page_comment_time": ["26 Ogos, 2012 08:36", "26 Ogos, 2012 09:09", "26 Ogos, 2012 09:09", "26 Ogos, 2012 09:21", "28 Disember, 2012 23:37", "28 Disember, 2012 23:40", "09 September, 2016 17:30", "15 Februari, 2013 02:39", "15 Februari, 2013 06:30", "15 Mac, 2013 13:18", "15 Mac, 2013 19:39", "16 Mei, 2013 11:47", "16 Mei, 2013 12:06", "23 September, 2013 15:22", "16 November, 2013 11:48", "01 Disember, 2013 22:33", "25 Februari, 2014 10:12", "01 April, 2014 10:38", "01 April, 2014 10:45", "09 April, 2014 08:43", "19 April, 2014 03:37", "12 Julai, 2014 16:48", "18 Julai, 2014 14:03", "07 Ogos, 2014 17:17", "31 Disember, 2014 12:13", "04 April, 2015 19:14", "25 Mei, 2015 14:08", "28 Mei, 2015 15:27", "11 September, 2015 09:42", "18 Oktober, 2015 14:00", "03 November, 2015 17:21", "29 November, 2015 19:53", "29 November, 2015 22:28", "02 Disember, 2015 11:04", "18 Disember, 2015 16:04", "26 Disember, 2015 02:15", "05 Januari, 2016 20:19", "11 April, 2016 18:33", "24 April, 2016 17:47", "09 Mei, 2016 14:16", "06 Jun, 2016 12:14", "22 Jun, 2016 00:36", "22 Jun, 2016 01:00", "18 Julai, 2016 21:03", "01 Ogos, 2016 17:01", "09 Oktober, 2016 20:05", "26 November, 2016 00:56", "06 Januari, 2017 17:53", "23 Februari, 2017 14:20", "16 Jun, 2017 13:32", "04 Januari, 2020 18:35"], "page_comment_user": ["Delima Zamrud", "Azie", "mama ju", "Azie", "TimMie", "Azie", "Hadzrul Rubaai", "Azie", "Azie", "Azie", "Unknown", "Acik Wawa", "Unknown", "Unknown", "fisya_fana the best", "Azie", "ayuzan", "Unknown", "Unknown", "Unknown", "Unknown", "Unknown", "Unknown", "Iffah Yazid", "Unknown", "Unknown", "Luna Merza", "Unknown", "Azi", "Azie", "Unknown", "Unknown", "Unknown", "Perunding Takaful Selangor", "Unknown", "Nor Lailee Ahmad", "Square scarf", "Unknown", "aye_parfait92", "Azie", "Unknown", "Unknown", "Bukusayabaca", "Unknown", "U