ndakan. Yang penting doh yang terhasil tidak melekat di tangan. ", "Salam kak azie... Tq atas resepi2 akak...nk tnya utk resepi ne.. Anggaran berapa bnyak biji dapat ye...tq", "sis, bahan bahan di atas anggaran berapa biji ye dpt", "Assalamualaikum kak azie.. boleh tunjukkan tak jenis tepung beras tu.. macam mana beras pulut n macam mana tepung beras.. tunjukkan plastik dia", "wslm. pergi kedai jer, minta tepung beras dan tepung beras pulut. ada tulis di plastik tu.", "First time belajar memasak dulu..sy google.. Sy suka ambil resepi dr page akak.. Sbb senang faham \ud83d\ude0atq kak byk share resepi", "Saya pon sama jugasaya suka ambik resepi dari puan.Saya suka makan kuih buah melaka ni.Kecik2 dah pandai masak\ud83d\ude0a", "As-salamu-'alai-kum. Kami di Johor x samakan onde-onde dgn kuih buah Melaka, sebab keduanya berbeza. Yg Azie tunjukkan ni kuih buah Melaka. Onde-onde "], "page_comment_time": ["10 Julai, 2013 15:49", "16 Julai, 2013 09:37", "20 Oktober, 2013 16:33", "30 Jun, 2014 12:57", "01 Julai, 2014 20:03", "28 Ogos, 2014 15:26", "18 November, 2014 09:48", "04 Jun, 2016 12:27", "04 Jun, 2016 18:22", "29 April, 2015 14:41", "21 Jun, 2015 12:25", "21 Jun, 2015 15:08", "26 Jun, 2015 15:18", "04 Jun, 2016 18:23", "05 Julai, 2015 17:13", "18 Disember, 2015 17:32", "21 Disember, 2015 06:16", "21 Disember, 2015 18:25", "06 Mac, 2016 09:26", "28 Mei, 2016 12:28", "06 Jun, 2016 01:18", "06 Jun, 2016 11:27", "06 Jun, 2016 11:41", "06 Jun, 2016 16:07", "08 Jun, 2016 07:44", "08 Jun, 2016 09:41", "13 Jun, 2016 16:25", "13 Jun, 2016 16:27", "29 Jun, 2016 16:39", "29 Jun, 2016 18:00", "14 Mei, 2017 16:01", "10 Jun, 2017 07:36", "01 Julai, 2016 14:07", "12 Mei, 2017 11:26", "13 Mei, 2017 16:53", "07 Jun, 2017 14:17", "11 Jun, 2017 13:43", "11 Jun, 2017 13:45", "12 Jun, 2017 12:04", "13 Jun, 2017 12:37", "16 Julai, 2017 05:42", "06 Ogos, 2017 20:38", "24 November, 2017 12:23", "24 November, 2017 12:31", "25 Mei, 2018 09:05", "25 Mei, 2018 12:45", "27 Mei, 2018 06:50", "25